  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expansion y sostenibilidad de la Respuesta al VIH en Paraguay - Paraguay (01-Mar-2015-28-Feb-2018)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Paraguay, HIV, Centro de Informaci&#xf3;n y Recursos para el Desarrollo (CIRD)This program has the following goals: Continuous improvement in the collection, processing and strategic reporting of data on HIV, TB/HIV co-infection and STIs integrated into the national surveillance network and the Directorate General of Strategic Health Information (DIGIES).  Contributing to reducing HIV transmission in key populations.  Deconcentrating of care and prevention for HIV, STIs and TB with quality standards in priority regions. The objectives of this program are: Ensure treatment with ARV for TB patients diagnosed with HIV, in line with protocols. / Asegurar el tratamiento con ARV a los pacientes con TB diagnosticados con VIH, seg&#xfa;n lo establecido en los protocolos.  Expand coverage of care and prevention services for HIV, STIs and TB in the priority regions / Ampliar la cobertura de los servicios de atenci&#xf3;n y prevenci&#xf3;n del VIH/ITS y TB en las regiones priorizadas.  Improve quality and speed of the notification of HIV diagnosis, integrated with the surveillance system. / Mejorar la calidad y la oportunidad de la notificaci&#xf3;n de VIH, integrada al sistema de vigilancia.  Reduce the gap between estimated population and enrollment by the third year. / Reducir la brecha entre personas estimadas y personas vinculadas, al tercer a&#xf1;o.  Reduce the shortfall in HIV diagnosis among the key population / Disminuir la brecha del diagn&#xf3;stico del VIH en poblaci&#xf3;n clave</narrative>
  </description>
